# Shell scripts and Containerfiles are consumed by Linux tooling (Podman in
# WSL2, GitHub Actions runners). Without this, a Windows clone checks them out
# with CRLF and the container's `#!/bin/sh` shebang fails with
# "bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M" — the image builds fine on CI and breaks only
# for local Windows builds.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.dockerfile text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Dockerfile.* text eol=lf
